                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "checkin_date",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "(Required) Refers to the hotel check-in date and must be in the format YYYY-MM-DD."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "checkout_date",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "(Required) Refers to the hotel check-out date and must be in the format YYYY-MM-DD."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "currency",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Refers to the currency, which must be filled with three alphabetical digits. (E.g. \"USD\", \"ARS\")"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "distribution",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Passenger distribution. Each room’s passengers should be written as number_of_adults-children_ages. Children-age goes up to 17 years old. Rooms should be separated by “!”. E.g.: Means room 1 with 2 adults and room 2 with 2 adults and a 10-year-old child."
