                  "description": "Refers to the language, which must be filled with two alphabetical digits."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "ttl",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "Maximum time allowed for the connection. Minimum = 3000 ms, Maximum = 6200 ms."
